Short:        sourcecode for Psygnosis' Agony (+more)
Author:       Yves Grolet
Uploader:     aminet aminet net
Type:         game/shoot
Architecture: generic

Yves Grolet has released a backup of his last Amiga hard drive to the public,
as explained here:

https://www.facebook.com/yves.grolet/posts/10222868958655944

License (quoting from the above announcement): "You can do whatever you want
with those sources excepting commercial use".

The archive contains the sources for his commercial Amiga game 'Agony', as 
well as a bunch of other, smaller  projects and prototypes.

Since the original release was a whopping 164 MB and contained a whole bunch 
of copyrighted files, we removed everything not directly related to to Yves' 
work.

Removed files
-------------

This directory and its contents were removed since the files just documented 
the progress of backing up Yves' harddrive:


Restoration images & videos (thanks Franck)/
	FileServerReadyInDF0.jpg
	FileTransferFailure.mp4
	FileTransferOK.mp4
	InstallingGotekWithFileServer01.jpg


